{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OUTBREAK</strong> is a fast-paced third-person action survival game where every wave pushes you closer to the edge. Face relentless hordes of zombies that grow stronger with each attack and fight for your life in a world consumed by chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wave-Based Survival</strong> \u2013 Endless waves of zombies with escalating difficulty will test your reflexes and strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo or Online Co-Op</strong> \u2013 Survive the apocalypse alone for the ultimate challenge, or team up with a friend to fight side by side.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management</strong> \u2013 Earn gold by defeating enemies, then spend it between waves to strengthen your defenses, place traps, and prepare for the next assault.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Growing Challenge</strong> \u2013 Each round introduces deadlier threats, forcing you to adapt your tactics or be overrun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Fight through a tense, grim world where every shot and every second counts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f OUTBREAK blends <strong>intense combat</strong>, <strong>strategic planning</strong>, and a <strong>dark survival atmosphere</strong> to deliver a heart-pounding zombie experience. The question is simple: <i>how long can you last?</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3984840?t=1758081938","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3984840?t=1758081938","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps